    'Applied when someone chooses a password: profile, reset and WooCommerce sign-up. Existing passwords keep working.' => 'S\'aplica quan algú tria una contrasenya: perfil, restabliment i alta de WooCommerce. Les contrasenyes actuals continuen funcionant.',
